{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128173034661-1128_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261128173034\"/><p>維珍尼亞州出現洪水。</p><p>美國東岸多地感恩節受到風暴吹襲，截至周五（27日）晚仍有逾25萬戶停電，逾3,400班航班延誤，近670班取消。新澤西州到維珍尼亞州部分沿海地區，仍處於洪水警報之下。</p><p>氣象部門預計，東岸天氣將逐步好轉，但影響持續。另一場風暴將為美國西北部多地帶來降雨，蒙大拿州和懷俄明州部分山區將出現強降雪。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T09:56:53.275172+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T09:30:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T09:50:29.133522+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T09:50:29.133522+00:00","content_hash":"bb57fd4066c223654e5167822743fec968024c409123f2f2da8a431e043fea96","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}